lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">House of Andechs</span><span class="enc-type">People / group</span><span class="enc-snip">The counts of Andechs were a Bavarian noble family named after their castle above the Ammersee.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/house-of-armagnac"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/house-of-armagnac.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">House of Armagnac</span><span class="enc-type">People / group</span><span class="enc-snip">The House of Armagnac was a noble family of Gascony, counts of Armagnac from the 10th century and of Rodez from 1302.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/house-of-ascania"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/house-of-ascania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">House of Ascania</span><span class="enc-type">People / group</span><span class="enc-snip">The House of Ascania is a German princely dynasty named after Aschersleben in Saxony-Anhalt.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/house-of-assembly-of-barbados"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/house-of-assembly-of-barbados.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">House of Assembly of Barbados</span><span class="enc-type">Institution</span><span class="enc-snip">The House of Assembly is the elected lower house of the Parliament of Barbados, first convened in 1639 and one of the oldest legislatures in the Americas.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/house-of-auersperg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/house-of-auersperg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">House of Auersperg</span><span class="enc-type">People / group</span><span class="enc-snip">The House of Auersperg is an Austrian noble family originating in C